  "instructions": [
    "heat the olive oil in a large clay tajine over medium-high heat.",
    "saute the chopped onion and minced garlic until softened.",
    "add the chopped mixed bell peppers and cook until tender.",
    "add the Arborio rice and cook for 1-2 minutes, stirring constantly.",
    "add 2 cups of water to the tajine and bring to a boil.",
    "reduce the heat to low and simmer for 18-20 minutes, or until the rice is tender and the liquid has been absorbed.",
    "stir in the honey and cook for an additional 2-3 minutes.",
    "season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "garnish with crispy fried shallots and chopped fresh parsley.",
    "serve immediately."
